AI-HPP Standard repository licensing
====================================

This repository uses separate licenses for standards content and software.
The applicable license is determined by the file path as documented below
and in REUSE.toml.

Standards and documentation
---------------------------

Documentation, specifications, schemas, data, and historical standard
materials are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International license (CC BY-SA 4.0). The complete license text is available
at LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

Software
--------

Scripts, tests, reference implementation examples, CI configuration, and
other repository tooling are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The complete license text is available at LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Trademarks
----------

Copyright licenses do not grant permission to use AI-HPP names, logos, or
certification marks as trademarks. See TRADEMARKS.md for the trademark policy.

Unless a file states otherwise, the path-based declarations in REUSE.toml
identify its copyright and license information.
